[{"type":"text","text":"The type exists so that those two are the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"same slot","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Before it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every line was declared as one or the other, and which one it got was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the engine’s own prose showing through the API: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dig"},{"type":"text","text":" was a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because the engine’s dig line happens to name nothing, so no game could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"write one that did without an engine change — and that change broke"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every game which had already assigned the old shape, whether it wanted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the name or not. Widening a line is now the business of the game that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wants it, and costs the games that don’t nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Object","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" says what the line is about. A line whose every parser row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries a direct object takes a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and is written with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/naming(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". One that also answers a bare command — ","type":"text"},{"code":"smell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"climb","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"wake","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — takes ","type":"text"},{"code":"Noun?","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and is written with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/naming(orBare:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asks for both halves so neither can be left in the engine’s voice by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accident. A verb with no object slot at all takes ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Nothing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": there is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no name to hand it, but there is still a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"turn","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to write it in, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/live(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which subjects exist is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/LineSubject"},{"type":"text","text":"; how a line about each may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"written","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the two protocols refining it — "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/DroppableSubject"},{"type":"text","text":" for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed sentence, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/NamedSubject"},{"type":"text","text":" for a closure. All three are protocols"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than lists in a doc comment, because a list in a doc comment is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list somebody has to remember to edit."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The shape is therefore about what the sentence is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"given"}]},{"type":"text","text":", never about"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how it is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"built"}]},{"text":". Every one of them takes a string literal, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed spelling of any line is the same three tokens whatever slot it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sits in.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The object arrives as a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and never as a bare string,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reason "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Noun"},{"type":"text","text":" exists: it carries its own number, so “The rails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is not food.” — a game’s honest plural made ungrammatical by a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"template’s assumption — cannot be written. Interpolating one prints its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"phrase, so a line with no verb to agree reads exactly as it would have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StockLine","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s43ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s32ExpressibleByStringInterpolationP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s26ExpressibleByStringLiteralP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s33ExpressibleByUnicodeScalarLiteralP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMeta